  "worked_solution": "To get the minor of  ${q}_{23}$, we remove the $2$nd row and $3$rd column:\n\n$$\nQ=[\\begin{aligned}1 & 2 & \u2217 & 1 \\\\ \u2217 & \u2217 & 1 & \u2217 \\\\ -1 & 1 & \u2217 & 0 \\\\ 4 & 5 & \u2217 & 0\\end{aligned}]\n$$\n\nSo, the minor is \n\n$$\n{M}_{23}=|\\begin{aligned}1 & 2 & 1 \\\\ -1 & 1 & 0 \\\\ 4 & 5 & 0\\end{aligned}|.\n$$",
